    "Besides the timer, the app watches ~/.claude/projects and ~/.codex/sessions and rescans a few seconds after files change. Conflicts and open conversations are never synced automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除定时扫描外，app 还会监听 ~/.claude/projects 和 ~/.codex/sessions 的文件变动，有更新时会延迟几秒自动扫描。冲突和正在使用的对话永远不会自动同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除咗定時掃描，app 亦會監察 ~/.claude/projects 同 ~/.codex/sessions 嘅檔案變動，有更新會延遲幾秒自動掃描。衝突同使用中嘅對話永遠唔會自動同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
