    "Codex Desktop imported this conversation again. The original is already synced, so this copy is never synced or copied. You can archive it in Codex.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 Codex Desktop 重复导入的副本，原对话已在同步中，不会再同步或复制。可以在 Codex 中归档。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "呢個係 Codex Desktop 重複匯入嘅副本，原本嘅對話已經同步緊，唔會再同步或者複製。可以喺 Codex 封存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
